# Accepted with a reason, rather than a severity threshold quietly raised until
# nothing reports.
#
# DS-0002 — "Specify at least 1 USER command". The only Containerfile this now
# reaches is containers/rust-build, a BUILD STAGE discarded once the binary is
# copied out (D63); it never runs anywhere, and installing a toolchain needs
# root. A build that cannot install a toolchain is not more secure, it is broken.
#
# containers/runtime declares `USER 65532:65532` explicitly, so it does not rely
# on this line — remove the ignore and only the build image reappears.
DS-0002
